ethercat (1.6.9+parallelop1~pre8) unstable; urgency=medium

  * CI: drop --fix-missing in the apt retry loop; --fix-missing was
    masking partial installs (git silently skipped, later steps failed
    with "git: not found"). Retry both apt-get update and install,
    fail loudly if a package is still missing.

